                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding TallyReportStatus}" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextSecondaryBrush}" FontSize="10" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding TallyReportStatus}" Margin="0,7,0,0"/>

